* MAX4766C MACROMODEL
* ----------------------------
* Revision 1. 12/2004
* ----------------------------
* The MAX4766C is a programmable current-limit switch that provides 
* a +/-10% accurate current limit and operates from 2.25V to 4.5V
* input voltage range
* ----------------------------
* Connections
*       1 = SETB
*       2 = FLAG\
*       3 = SETI
*       4 = OUT
*       5 = IN 
*       6 = SETS
*       7 = ON
*       8 = GND
*-----------------------------
**************************************************
